The hall of deeds. Experience 105, gold 160. Quests 1 of 5; achievements 3 of 6.
[x] Hold the bridge in summer: Win the first level of Defend the Bridge.
[ ] Hold the bridge in every season: Win all three levels: summer, snow and the storm.
[ ] Find the way in: Walk the battlefield on foot to the castle gate.
[ ] Cross the long bridge: Hold the bridge, then cross to the castle.
[ ] Stand in the treasury: Find your way through the gate maze and the dungeon to the castle's gold.
 *  First blood: Won a level of Castle Defense.
 *  A full purse: Held 150 gold at once.
 *  Veteran: Earned 100 experience.
